stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: Home opens
  Collapsed: Show mail priorities
  Loading: Loading mail priorities
  Ready: Ranked recorded decisions
  Empty: No recorded pending decisions
  Unavailable: Mail priorities unavailable, retry
  Retired: Sign in to view mail priorities
  Disposed: Home closed
  Collapsed --> Loading: Choose Show mail priorities
  Loading --> Collapsed: Choose Hide mail priorities, page hidden or pagehide
  Ready --> Collapsed: Choose Hide mail priorities, page hidden or pagehide
  Empty --> Collapsed: Choose Hide mail priorities, page hidden or pagehide
  Unavailable --> Collapsed: Choose Hide mail priorities, page hidden or pagehide
  Collapsed --> Collapsed: Ignore stale completion
  Loading --> Ready: Valid populated response
  Loading --> Empty: Valid empty response
  Loading --> Unavailable: Failure, unavailable or malformed response
  Unavailable --> Loading: Choose Retry mail priorities
  Ready --> Loading: Choose Refresh mail priorities
  Empty --> Loading: Choose Refresh mail priorities
  Ready --> Ready: Choose existing card review
  Loading --> Retired: Authorization refused or session retired
  Collapsed --> Retired: Session retired
  Ready --> Retired: Session retired
  Empty --> Retired: Session retired
  Unavailable --> Retired: Session retired
  Loading --> Disposed: Home unmounts, discard late completion
  Ready --> Disposed: Home unmounts
  Collapsed --> Disposed: Home unmounts
  Empty --> Disposed: Home unmounts
  Unavailable --> Disposed: Home unmounts
  Retired --> Disposed: Home unmounts
  Retired --> Retired: Ignore stale completion
  Disposed --> Disposed: Ignore stale completion
  %% never Send, approve or dismiss from this panel
  %% never Reorder or infer dates
  %% never Poll or automatically retry
  %% never Commit a stale completion after collapse, hiding, retirement or disposal
